{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_091_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "4a8f2d8535bdd4d64c2c6deade6f868ffa094f3bedb62cd4aba3a09c2a10ea01", "ja": "見てよ、雪歩、のり子！\nこれ、母さんが、沖縄の\n写真を送ってくれたんだー！", "zh": "你们看，雪歩、のり子！\n这是妈妈寄来的\n冲绳照片——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_091_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "22c8525a153ae8cc312c4ae687e696e779f34798d9d6cd73fec2157c0b7f241d", "ja": "わあっ、さすが沖縄の海！\nすっごくキレイだね！", "zh": "哇啊，真不愧是冲绳的大海！\n超级漂亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_091_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "70719d8f681035ebacf0af78a5665c4c0dba68011b5025265e31653269770baa", "ja": "うん！　海が透き通ってて……\n私も行ってみたいなぁ……♪", "zh": "嗯！海水清澈见底……\n我也想去看看呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_091_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "dca06bb221caa8cebd6d18e28be1ab6e79617d2280e1f3a22ff9d42bb1194b64", "ja": "沖縄のビーチは最高だからね！\n自分も、いつかみんなのこと\n連れていきたいぞ！", "zh": "冲绳的海滩最棒了！\n我也想哪天带大家\n一起去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_091_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "521d8ce595e7dcda86ef4a8d664f0bac63b2b097f9a77b32661a6fe609f3b421", "ja": "ホント？　楽しみ～！\nアタシ、どうせなら\n美味しいものが食べたいな～。", "zh": "真的？好期待呀～！\n我嘛，既然要去的话，\n还是想吃好吃的东西～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_091_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dc30c667a4a015fe7398c57119a699a9247557a251c526ddc87756aac5feb90f", "ja": "沖縄には、名物が\nたくさんあるもんね。響ちゃんは、\n何がおすすめかな……？", "zh": "冲绳有好多特产呢。响，\n你推荐什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
